From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pilote Production <75377040+PiloteCode@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:38:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/37] merge fork PRs #854 + #993 (PiloteCode: wave64 programs
 in a paired form on 32-lane GPUs, geometry programs, loops as the console
 runs them, split dispatches)

Conflicts resolved onto daily-pr2: #995 (indirect runs: a split dispatch is never in a
run; amplified mesh pipelines use the linked mesh/pixel codes; test-host root signature
keeps both extra parameters and bounded UAVs; wave-wide mode kept with the paired-first
closure), #927 (halves port into descriptor_data.rs, unread high half beside FIRST_HALF),
(site_pairs: ir test expectation updated, the pair comes back whole without shared slots).
wave64_tests.rs taken from #993 (Windows-only tests).

Kit-Source: victory-fork PRs #854 + #993 (PiloteCode), squashed together
Kit-Licence: GPL-3.0
